# Two rules used to live here and are now in the repository root's .gitignore,
# because what they protect moved out of this directory:
#
#   .scratch/wire-capture/raw/   the tickets are at the root now
#   tools/ui-driver/frames.log   spelled from the root as server/tools/...
#
# The first matters: it keeps unredacted proxy recordings, which carry live
# session tokens, out of a public repository.

